# Client profile overview and communications

## Invariants — do not regress

1. Communications bodies (calls, texts, emails, notes) show the full text.
   No character cap and no Show more / Show less.
2. Overview notes stay short. Clicking one opens Communications at
   `#comm-{id}` and scrolls to that full message. Do not open a full-note
   modal on Overview.
3. Overview order is Appointments, then Notes.
4. Saving a communication or an overview note adds that row to the list on
   screen immediately. `router.refresh()` alone is not enough: the list is
   local state copied from server props.
5. Account Manager and Client Services menus include every admin and anyone
   with that department checked. The hidden dev account stays off the lists.
   Show the person's name, or their email when the name is blank. Render the
   open menu outside overflow clipping so the names stay visible.
